<th id="A2.T7.2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Mistral (fine-tuned)</th>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">.670</td>
